<title>RUSSIA: Russia's Sberbank mandates WestMerchant for loan.</title>
<headline>Russia's Sberbank mandates WestMerchant for loan.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's biggest bank, Sberegatelny Bank RF (Sberbank) said on Tuesday it had mandated the investment arm of Westdeutsche Landesbank Girozentrale, WestMerchant Bank Ltd, to arrange a $200 million loan.</p>
<p>Sberbank said in a statement the loan would be a one-year syndicated facility.</p>
<p>The credit is Sberbank's first foreign loan, a Sberbank spokesman said.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
